    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin extends the capabilities of WordPress to turn it into a complete text messaging (SMS) gateway.</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Add endpoints to the Rest API to send and check the status of SMS.</li>\n<li>Allows you to connect an unlimited number of Android devices. The more devices connected, the higher the availability of the gateway.</li>\n<li>Customized sending. Since SMS are sent with the mobile lines of Android devices, the costs applied will depend on them. It&#8217;s good to keep in mind that in many countries local text messages are free.</li>\n<li>Shows real-time and refined information on the status of devices as well as SMS.</li>\n<li>Allows you to schedule SMS sending.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Get Started</h3>\n<p>Visit the Official Website to get started.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sms-gateway-press.andaniel05.cu\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">sms-gateway-press.andaniel05.cu</a></p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='where%20to%20get%20the%20android%20app%3F'>\nWhere to get the Android app?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The Android app may be downloaded <a href=\"https://sms-gateway-press.andaniel05.cu/download-app\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">from here</a></p>\n</p>\n\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Self-hosted SMS Gateway. Send SMS with your own Android devices across your WordPress site.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin extends the capabilities of WordPress to turn it into a complete text messaging (SMS) gateway.</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Add endpoints to the Rest API to send and check the status of SMS.</li>\n<li>Allows you to connect an unlimited number of Android devices. The more devices connected, the higher the availability of the gateway.</li>\n<li>Customized sending. Since SMS are sent with the mobile lines of Android devices, the costs applied will depend on them. It&#8217;s good to keep in mind that in many countries local text messages are free.</li>\n<li>Shows real-time and refined information on the status of devices as well as SMS.</li>\n<li>Allows you to schedule SMS sending.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Get Started</h3>\n<p>Visit the Official Website to get started.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sms-gateway-press.andaniel05.cu\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">sms-gateway-press.andaniel05.cu</a></p>\n",
